# PROJECT INFORMATION:

Project Name: LinkedList Implementation in PHP
Author: GilangRiskyM
Created: 2025-06-25 07:33:58 UTC
Repository: PHP LinkedList with Separate Operations

# DESCRIPTION:

This project provides a comprehensive implementation of LinkedList data structure
in PHP with modular design. Each operation (append, insert, delete, search) is
implemented in separate files using PHP traits for maximum flexibility and
maintainability.

# FEATURES:

- Modular design with separate operation files
- Step-by-step execution logging
- Comprehensive error handling
- Unit testing capabilities
- Visual representation of LinkedList operations
- Support for both Node objects and direct data manipulation

# FILES INCLUDED:

- Node.php - Basic Node class
- LinkedListBase.php - Base class with utilities
- AppendOperation.php - Append operations trait
- InsertOperation.php - Insert operations trait
- DeleteOperation.php - Delete operations trait
- SearchOperation.php - Search operations trait
- LinkedList.php - Main class combining all traits
- demo.php - Complete demonstration
- test_append.php - Append operation testing
- README.md - Project documentation

